{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49115","headline":"临江仙 · 後主煜","name":"临江仙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"樱桃落尽春归去，蝶飜轻粉双飞。\n子规啼月小楼西，玉钩罗幕，惆怅暮烟垂。\n别巷寂寥人散後，望残烟草低迷。\n炉香闲嫋凤皇儿，空持罗带，回首恨依依。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"後主煜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49115.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49115","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}